{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}About Liam’s Listeners{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<h1>About Liam’s Listeners</h1>

<p>
    <strong>Liam’s Listeners (LL)</strong> is a music album review platform created for the
    Advanced Web Development module. The site allows users to explore albums, read reviews,
    and share their own thoughts on music they love.
</p>

<p>
    Registered users can write reviews, rate albums, and participate in our growing community.
    Administrators have the ability to create album listings to ensure accuracy and maintain
    high quality content throughout the platform.
</p>

<h2>Our Purpose</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Make it simple and enjoyable to discover new music.</li>
    <li>Provide a platform where listeners can share honest album reviews.</li>
    <li>Offer an interface powered by Symfony, Twig, and Doctrine ORM.</li>
</ul>

<h2>The Project</h2>

<p>
    This application was built as part of a university final year project. It demonstrates:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Symfony MVC architecture</li>
    <li>User authentication & authorisation</li>
    <li>Role-based access controls</li>
    <li>Album and review management</li>
    <li>Image uploads and advanced filtering</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Thank you for exploring Liam’s Listeners!  
    Feel free to browse albums, leave reviews, and enjoy the music.
</p>

{% endblock %}
